# Software to Hardware

## 9. Software-to-Hardware Flow

A high-level software application eventually needs to execute on hardware.

A simplified flow is:

    Application Software
            |
            v
    Programming Language
            |
            v
         Compiler
            |
            v
    Assembly / Machine Instructions
            |
            v
    Instruction Set Architecture
            |
            v
      Processor Hardware
            |
            v
        Digital Logic
            |
            v
         Transistors

The ISA acts as an interface between software and processor implementation.

