# SoC

## 10. What is SoC?

SoC stands for **System on Chip**.

An SoC integrates multiple components of a complete system onto a single chip.

### An SoC May Contain

- CPU
- Memory
- GPIO
- Timers
- UART
- SPI
- I2C
- Interrupt controller
- Bus interconnect
- Analog blocks
- Other IP blocks

### Simplified SoC

    +----------------------------------+
    |               SoC                |
    |                                  |
    |   +-------+      +----------+   |
    |   |  CPU  |------|  Memory  |   |
    |   +-------+      +----------+   |
    |       |                          |
    |       v                          |
    |   +---------+                    |
    |   |   Bus   |                    |
    |   +---------+                    |
    |    |   |   |                     |
    |    v   v   v                     |
    |  UART GPIO  SPI                  |
    |                                  |
    +----------------------------------+

