# Logic Synthesis

## 32. Logic Synthesis

Logic synthesis converts RTL into a gate-level netlist.

    RTL
     |
     v
    Synthesis Tool
     |
     v
    Gate-Level Netlist

The synthesis tool maps the design to available standard cells.

### Example Cells

- AND
- OR
- NOT
- MUX
- DFF
- NAND
- NOR

